* Same stand-in with the RT resistor on its own node, as when a schematic wire stops short of the RT pin
.subckt OSCRT RT SW VIN GND
Vref ref GND 1
Rs ref RT 1
Rint RT GND 1meg
Bph ph GND V=idt(2.524e11*I(Rs))
Bsw SW GND V=V(VIN)*(0.5+0.5*tanh(4*sin(2*pi*V(ph))))
.ends
V1 IN 0 4
XU1 RT SW IN 0 OSCRT
R47 NC_09 0 270k
L1 SW OUT 2.2u
C1 OUT 0 10u
Rload OUT 0 10
.tran 0 100u 0 10n
.end
